      en: ["Construction spanned 78 years, beginning in 1848 and finishing in 1926.", "The building is constructed entirely of yellow sandstone from local quarries.", "Danish architect Thomas Reed designed the original neoclassical structure.", "The Elliptical Chamber is the traditional venue for presidential inaugurations.", "Famed artist Santiago Martínez Delgado painted the interior's historical murals.", "It was officially designated as a National Monument on August 11, 1975."],
      es: ["Sede del Senado y de la Cámara de Representantes.", "Estilo arquitectónico puramente neoclásico.", "Tiempo de construcción de casi 80 años (1848–1926).", "Construido con piedra arenisca tallada a mano de la región de Bogotá.", "Alberga el famoso mural 'El Congreso de Cúcuta' de Santiago Martínez.", "Monumento Nacional y corazón de la Plaza de Bolívar."],
      pt: ["Sede do Senado e da Câmara dos Representantes.", "Estilo arquitetônico puramente neoclássico.", "Tempo de construção de quase 80 anos (1848–1926).", "Construído com arenito esculpido à mão da região de Bogotá.", "Abriga o famoso mural 'O Congresso de Cúcuta' de Santiago Martínez.", "Monumento Nacional e coração da Plaza de Bolívar."],
      fr: ["Siège du Sénat et de la Chambre des représentants.", "Style architectural purement néoclassique.", "Durée de construction de près de 80 ans (1848-1926).", "Construit en grès taillé à la main provenant de la région de Bogotá.", "Abrite la célèbre fresque « El Congreso de Cúcuta » de Santiago Martínez.", "Monument national et cœur de la Plaza de Bolívar."],
